model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "PostgreSQL fixture siblings cannot overtake their awaited statement during cold startup. Callback-once waits for INSERT completion; group-drain completes its existing connection read before starting both branches, with startup still inside the original timing window. Delayed-readiness cases hold the first ReadyForQuery for 30 ms and retain the original outcomes, overlap and deadlines. Production pool code stays unchanged. The lock-race fixture completes startup before its inserted-and-gaveUp coordination; deterministic gates cannot be replaced by an extra duplicate signal or a startup sleep."
    }
  }
}
